    <h1>Website Terms and Conditions</h1>
    <p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> June 1, 2026<br><strong>Website:</strong> kmcmassagewellness.com<br><strong>Business:</strong> KMC Massage and Wellness P.C.<br><strong>Location:</strong> 438600 Garfield Rd, Ste 101. Clinton Twp, MI 48038</p>
    <p>These Terms and Conditions govern your access to and use of this website, including any online scheduling, intake, contact, payment, or related services offered through the website. By using this website, booking an appointment, submitting information, or purchasing services, you agree to these Terms.</p>
    <p><strong>1. Massage Therapy Services</strong></p>
    <p>KMC Massage and Wellness P.C. provides massage therapy and related wellness services in Macomb County, Michigan. Services are provided by properly licensed or otherwise authorized providers as required by applicable Michigan law.</p>
    <p>Massage therapy services are intended to support general wellness, relaxation, muscular comfort, and related therapeutic goals. Massage therapy is not a substitute for medical diagnosis, medical treatment, physical therapy, chiropractic care, mental health care, or emergency medical services.</p>
    <p>If you have a medical condition, injury, pregnancy-related concern, recent surgery, contagious condition, severe pain, unexplained symptoms, or any concern about whether massage therapy is appropriate for you, you should consult a licensed medical professional before booking or receiving services.</p>
    <p><strong>2. No Medical Advice</strong></p>
    <p><strong>Information on this website is provided for general informational purposes only. Nothing on this website should be interpreted as medical advice, diagnosis, treatment, or a promise of any specific result.</strong></p>
    <p><strong>You are responsible for disclosing relevant health information before receiving services, including allergies, injuries, medical conditions, medications, pregnancy status, recent surgeries, skin conditions, pain symptoms, and any other information that may affect whether massage therapy is appropriate for you.</strong></p>
    <p><strong>3. Online Scheduling and Client Information</strong></p>
