    <p>You agree that all information you provide will be accurate, current, and complete. You are responsible for updating us if your information changes or if any health-related information becomes inaccurate before your appointment.</p>
    <p>Submitting an appointment request does not guarantee availability. An appointment is not confirmed until you receive confirmation from us through the scheduling platform, email, text message, phone call, or other communication method used by the business.</p>
    <p><strong>4. Privacy and Personal Information</strong></p>
