    <p>Because scheduling or intake forms may collect personal or health-related information, you should not submit information through the website unless you are comfortable using the website and any third-party scheduling or payment platforms identified in the Privacy Policy.</p>
    <p>We use reasonable administrative, technical, and physical safeguards designed to protect personal information. <strong>However, no website, scheduling system, email system, text-message system, payment processor, or internet transmission is completely secure. You acknowledge that you submit information electronically at your own risk.</strong></p>
    <p><strong>5. Third-Party Scheduling, Payment, and Communication Platforms</strong></p>
